's broad weakness, the peso is again trading at pre-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels.\par \par \uc2 -By Anthony Esposito, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-715-8929; anthony.esposito@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 --Cristina Molina contributed to this article\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 September 07, 2011 13:05 ET (17:05 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020110907e79700574\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
