\par\par \b \uc2 SURVEY: Chile  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Seen Raising Benchmark Rate 25BPs\b0\par\par\uc2 570 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Mai 2011\par 23:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    TPM Rate History (annual percentage): \par    Apr  Mar  Feb  Jan   Dec \par    4.5% 4.0% 3.5% 3.25% 3.25% \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 By Carolina Pica\f28 \par \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--As inflationary pressures and expectations show incipient signs of subsiding, the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will likely revert to a slower pace of interest-rate increases.\par \par \uc2 At its monthly monetary-policy meeting Thursday afternoon, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will probably raise the benchmark overnight rate 25 basis points to 4.75%, according to 12 of the 16 analysts Dow Jones Newswires polled. The four dissenters expect a larger, 50-basis-point increase.\par \par \uc2 At its March and April meetings, the bank surprised markets by putting its foot on the gas pedal and raising the benchmark rate, known locally as the TPM, 50 basis points at each meeting.\par \par \uc2 The recently released April consumer price index data tempered some analysts outlook for an extended brisk rate-rise pace as headline annualized inflation was 3.2% and core inflation was 2.4%.\par \par \uc2 In addition, the narrower core inflation the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also looks at, known locally as IPCX1 which not only factors fuels and perishables but regulated services as well, only grew 0.7% on the year.\par \par \uc2 The three different measures of inflation are in line with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's target of 3%, plus/minus one percentage point and below the bank's outlook of 4.3% inflation at the end of 2011.\par \par \uc2 "The IPCX1 was low enough to give the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  room to slow down the rate increases," said Guillermo Kautz, head \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bond trader at local brokerage BCI.\par \par \uc2 In addition to the mild April data, the strength of the peso in relation to the dollar, despite a $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -market-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program, is also easing some inflationary pressures, analysts say.\par \par \uc2 With the peso trading at near three-year highs and pre-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels against the dollar, imports are less expensive.\par \par \uc2 As \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  imports 98% of the fuels it consumes and isn't self-sufficient in its food production, higher import prices pressure local inflation.\par \par \uc2 "The inflationary pressures we're seeing today aren't the result of the economy overheating. They are imported inflationary pressures from oil and food," Finance Minister Felipe Larrain said in prepared remarks Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Analysts add that the correction in the prices of commodities, including crude oil, have also relieved some of the imported inflationary pressures.\par \par \uc2 "We've recently seen a sharp retreat in oil prices which could quickly impact inflation readings in the next few months," said Matias Madrid, chief economist at Banco Penta.\par \par \uc2 Private-sector inflation expectations improved slightly in recent days, as the bank's most recent Monthly Survey of Analysts' Expectations show year-end 2011 and 2012 expectations fell 10 basis points to 4.3% and 3.4%, respectively.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will release its post-meeting communique after 2200 GMT Thursday.\par \par \uc2 -By Carolina Pica, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-715-8919; carolina.pica@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 TALK BACK: We invite readers to send us comments on this or other financial news topics. Please email us at TalkbackAmericas@dowjones.com. Readers should include their full names, work or home addresses and telephone numbers for verification purposes. We reserve the right to edit and publish your comments along with your name; we reserve the right not to publish reader comments. [ 10-05-11 2106GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110510e75a001hf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
